# <%= current_page.data.title %>

Weight Loss Plan helps make healthier food choices, set weight loss goals to helps users get more active and burn more calories.

The app follows the [standard pattern](documentation/guides/standard-pattern) but extends it slightly by using an OpenSearch cluster for its food search functionality.

## Architecture Overview

![Weight Loss Plan architecture](/images/weight-loss-plan-architecture.jpg)

## Components

### OpenSearch
The OpenSearch cluster is populated from the `products.json` file from [Food Scanner](documentation/services/fs) which is a concatenation of multiple product data sources. A scheduled ECS task regularly downloads this file and updates the OpenSearch cluster to ensure the search results remain current.

### Applications

- **Repo:** [weightloss-cms-iac](https://github.com/ukhsa-collaboration/weightloss-cms-iac) – Django CMS for the app.

### Infrastructure as Code

- **Repo:** [weightloss-iac](https://github.com/ukhsa-collaboration/weightloss-iac) – Terraform modules that infrastructure.

